body:
These seem like they shouldn't be valid:

``` js
var min, max, mean; min = 1; max = 10; mean = 4;

var a = {}; a[9] = 'test';
```

The intent of `detectObjects` was to toggle allowing this:

``` js
var foo = {
    bar: 5
};
```

I agree, this is confusing. We should figure out a way to clean this up.
